</div></div></div> <div n="1" type="jFeuilleton"> <div n="2" type="jArticle" xml:id="a2a" next="#a2b"><head><hi rendition="#c"><hi rendition="#b">Das Po&#x017F;tfräulein.</hi><lb/>
Hochlandsroman von <hi rendition="#g">Arthur Achleitner.</hi></hi><lb/>
<note>(3) <milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
